{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:14.55.390","page_type":"section"},"citation":"14.55.390","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.55.390","content_hash":"77d1d1a8aaa4da7012668ef2073313040996db6deba444fcc0c80c8b284dc9f5","heading":"Seat or bench elements.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.390:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.55.390","text":"Section R312.5, Seat or bench elements, is hereby created by the addition of the following provisions:\nGuards which incorporate seat or bench elements shall have a guard system complying with R312.2 and R312.3 to a height of 36 inches measured from the seat surface. The guard system shall also extend to the floor surface below the seat or bench element.\nExceptions:\n1. Porches, balconies or raised floors 30 inches or less above the floor or grade below.\n2. Freestanding moveable seat and bench elements.\n(Ord. 19727 § 36, 4-24-12.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"9c241f7c-1081-522c-9816-323d0888600b"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"14.55.390","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.55.390","content_hash":"1997b7035ec3db1d74bbd386bbf229132621f28e0efaa86e717a31b8497a4c1b","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.390:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.390:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.55.390","text":"Section R312.5, Seat or bench elements, is hereby created by the addition of the following provisions:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"10de85d4-487f-5f7d-9ac6-fcfc283c796d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind"